{{define "content"}}
<section class="one-time-result">
<h1>客户端接入凭据已生成</h1>
<div class="operation-refusal">接入凭据只显示这一次，刷新或返回都不会再出现；请立即复制保存。</div>
<dl class="one-time-fields">
<div><dt>客户端</dt><dd>{{.AccessDeviceIssued.Name}}</dd></div>
<div><dt>接入凭据</dt><dd class="secret-value">{{.AccessDeviceIssued.Code}}</dd></div>
<div><dt>权威端证书公钥指纹</dt><dd class="secret-value">{{.AccessDeviceIssued.Fingerprint}}</dd></div>
</dl>
<p>在工作机上执行：</p>
<pre><code>{{.AccessDeviceIssued.PullCommand}}</code></pre>
<p><a href="/ui/clients/">返回客户端列表</a></p>
</section>
{{end}}
